{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-起量管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于开启或更新一键起量方案，适用于oCPM计划、非nobid\\u0026自动化计划（旧版巨量引擎工作台，省心投）且状态为“投放中”的营销，每个起量方案生效时间为6小时，支持全量更新，传空则更新为空并删除已预约方案。需配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"tools.promotion_raise.set\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/promotion_raise/set/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1761603589597259\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1761603589597259\",\"title\":\"开启/更新一键起量\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VylFtWtg\">一键起量使用条件：oCPM计划、非nobid&amp;自动化计划（旧版巨量引擎工作台，省心投），仅状态为“投放中”的营销支持“立即生效”</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-q4G5iRKv\">每个起量方案生效时间为6小时，冲突会报错</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-yHI1U6UJ\">全量更新。传空则更新为空，此时已预约的方案将被删除，生效中的方案不受影响</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4XtzQp6v\"><br/></p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201760502012824588%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-2wLHRDCc\" id=\"h346b9f0-2wLHRDCc\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-GfY3Qcu6\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/promotion_raise/set/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/promotion_raise/set/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1761603589597259\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-YKCcI1rJ\" id=\"h346b9f0-YKCcI1rJ\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-YIeaPsRi\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-PVPe3mv3\" id=\"h346b9f0-PVPe3mv3\">Header</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-I4kCP0OI\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-mELR3Wbl\"><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-jV2hZLb6\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-mjZMXcbd\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-B0mSIWLY\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-mOJDAiQB\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-kmkBG33I\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-eOCOmbfS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lWQ5I8fV\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-n2hI19C3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CYCJgLCi\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-6WZ5beAK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dfKWjXmT\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-JGCE7bES\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-i9NSJ5UD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ljZQKkfg\">Access-Token <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RfEMw%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-AXO65U7j\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TCRUlp7L\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-e28JjHaD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aMabKX6Z\">授权access_token，可以通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"> 【获取Access token】</a>接口获取 </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-c7nXeULZ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-hjBiBBUd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EoLdCgop\">Content-Type <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZfuYu%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-3A8VNDCj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fejJDB6H\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-8gY9KSLR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EddtAGAh\">请求消息类型</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZOgOQ8Uh\">允许值: <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">application/json</code> </p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-opkYvmrl\" id=\"h346b9f0-opkYvmrl\">请求参数</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-BEPNhdSX\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-GiXHGS6k\"><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-fZESOUje\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-jNDoWBqg\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-WfeQBXD6\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-RjiUcaQ5\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-hKBJCSGQ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-mgiEb0Ja\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NeiqmY3D\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-9ERr3V4Z\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-u8M03uqk\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-K7XZNE51\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-t4a9pnlX\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-mo0dWJZF\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-j9kJsfbK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Tb3rOKx9\">advertiser_id <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dpp0F%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-QkoOU3NV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mnzTzK1f\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-nCZc8lF6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qdok5XJl\">客户ID </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-S6Maj3C1\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-QQYhnbSF\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Cz9IkgXf\">promotion_id <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s7w3x%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-mfZQ9K0G\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UQ0VJ769\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-Iopp5gAA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tE32Hwcx\">营销ID </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-cRkQp54A\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-uNO0GO7M\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-clrNEoK9\">raise_info <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jX8mY%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-klEOxnq5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kHYgUdVG\">object[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-CXD2IU5Y\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2BFyxXW1\">起量信息，如果需要全部删除请传[] </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-bRW6oZQA\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ucUh3Mu6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9YWp21VJ\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%221%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mX7Xg%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>raise_budget <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XtAzq%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-l3XtMtvQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-05vI5PrU\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-PCObafZr\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7CkAzxnr\">起量预算，单位：元，允许小数点后两位起量预算需大于等于计划出价，小于等于计划预算 </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-K0FhuYXS\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-gc1o41NY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OjLb36cB\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%221%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wczcw%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>is_effective_now <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%220bEbB%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-kRRpiDI3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hdCIYO3x\">bool</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-TeF80VL0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-viTZeDRH\">是否立即生效，仅支持营销状态为“投放中”的营销，仅支持1个方案设置“立即生效”，传入<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">True</code>时不支持填写appointed_time </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-07T514jO\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-cOSgvalA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-W0qfEHzr\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%221%22%2C%22id%22%3A%228nMll%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>appointed_time </p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-xtKnztpl\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qSILP2xF\">object</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-ESag4JEs\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zPmBVGA2\">指定投放时间，当is_effective_now为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">FALSE</code>时填写有效 </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-cWi6vaU0\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-7Y614pbY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0Xbjtqp1\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%222%22%2C%22id%22%3A%229ckpO%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>repeated_day </p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-hIBoMbgV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SAX28YBu\">string[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-F1ASq8pg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cGugJnNu\">重复周期，仅生效一次。不传则不重复，传入<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">EVERY_DAY</code>则每天重复</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-QTeRHBuB\">允许值：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-GRoyIyhl\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">PER_MONDAY</code>；<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">PER_TUESDAY</code>；<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">PER_WEDNESDAY</code>；<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">PER_THURSDAY</code>；<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">PER_FRIDAY</code>：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; 